From a96d111d42545c67d8658ecce93c26bc211816a0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: overdoingism <overdoingism@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 20:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ggml-cuda: RDNA4 verify-step fusions: GLU -> Q8_1, GDN conv
 at 2..255 tokens, batched state-snapshot copies

Three speculative-verify fusions that r8 does not have yet. Each is bit-identical and
default-on with its own kill switch:

- GLU -> Q8_1 (GGML_LF_GLU_Q8=0 off): the verify-step SwiGLU writes the Q8_1 activation
  for the next mmvq directly, instead of a separate quantize.
- VCONV (GGML_LF_VCONV=0 off): the fused GDN concat + conv also for 2..255-token batches.
- Batched copy (GGML_LF_CPY_BATCH=0 off): consecutive same-layout f32 CPY nodes (the GDN
  conv-state snapshots) in one launch.

Written by Claude (AI).
---
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/gdn-conv.cu  |   5 +-
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/ggml-cuda.cu |  36 +++++++++
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/lf-cpyb.cu   | 108 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/lf-cpyb.cuh  |   9 +++
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/lf-gluq8.cu  | 129 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/lf-gluq8.cuh |  17 +++++
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/unary.cu     |  39 +++++++++-
 7 files changed, 340 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
